      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic genital pains often baffle the physician, and leave him face to face with a certain therapeutic \"impotence\". Rather than launch a frontal attack on the genital pain symptom, we try to get round the difficulty by recourse to the psychocorporal techniques which we normally use in sex therapy."},
